      "dc:source": "australian-capital-territory-water-management-legislation-amendment-act-2013.pdf, p.8",
      "values:originalText": "Add:\n\n(2) The functions of the Authority under paragraph (1)(g) do not\ninclude:\n\n(a) the management of the taking of water on National Land; or\n\n(b) the regulation of the taking of water on National Land.\nNote 1:\nRegulations may be made for the purposes of section 27 of the\nAustralian Capital Territory (Self-Government) Act 1988 with the\neffect that the Water Resources Act 2007 (ACT) binds the Crown in\nright of the Commonwealth in respect of National Land.\nNote 2:\nThe Authority retains the function of approving works in Designated\nAreas under section 12.",
      "skos:definition": "Add:\n\n(2) The functions of the Authority under paragraph (1)(g) do not\ninclude:\n\n(a) the management of the taking of water on National Land; or\n\n(b) the regulation of the taking of water on National Land.\nNote 1:\nRegulations may be made for the purposes of section 27 of the\nAustralian Capital Territory (Self-Government) Act 1988 with the\neffect that the Water Resources Act 2007 (ACT) binds the Crown in\nright of the Commonwealth in respect of National Land.\nNote 2:\nThe Authority retains the function of approving works in Designated\nAreas under section 12.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-capital-territory-water-management-legislation-amendment-act-2013-sch-1-sec-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-capital-territory-water-management-legislation-amendment-act-2013-sch-1-sec-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "c8608d0ca1417c54f297688f86af59a04321dd2c548bc7f34c19dad16eb65d33",
      "skos:note": "Prohibits management and regulation of water on National Land by the Authority."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-capital-territory-water-management-legislation-amendment-act-2013#sch-1-sec-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "4 At the end of section 6",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 8,
      "values:originalText": "Add:\n\n(2) The functions of the Authority under paragraph (1)(g) do not\ninclude:\n\n(a) the management of the taking of water on National Land; or\n\n(b) the regulation of the taking of water on National Land.\nNote 1:\nRegulations may be made for the purposes of section 27 of the\nAustralian Capital Territory (Self-Government) Act 1988 with the\neffect that the Water Resources Act 2007 (ACT) binds the Crown in\nright of the Commonwealth in respect of National Land.\nNote 2:\nThe Authority retains the function of approving works in Designated\nAreas under section 12."
    },
