      "dc:source": "australian-capital-territory-water-management-legislation-amendment-act-2013.pdf, p.9",
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the paragraph, substitute:\n\n(a) a liability arises in respect of:\n\n(i) land at a time when it is Territory Land; or\n\n(ii) the management of the taking of water on National\nLand; or\n\n(iii) the regulation of the taking of water on National Land;\nand\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2013A00147\n\nSchedule 2  Water Act 2007\n\nAustralian Capital Territory Water Management Legislation\nAmendment Act 2013\nNo. 147, 2013",
      "skos:definition": "Repeal the paragraph, substitute:\n\n(a) a liability arises in respect of:\n\n(i) land at a time when it is Territory Land; or\n\n(ii) the management of the taking of water on National\nLand; or\n\n(iii) the regulation of the taking of water on National Land;\nand\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2013A00147\n\nSchedule 2  Water Act 2007\n\nAustralian Capital Territory Water Management Legislation\nAmendment Act 2013\nNo. 147, 2013",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-capital-territory-water-management-legislation-amendment-act-2013-sch-1-sec-8-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-capital-territory-water-management-legislation-amendment-act-2013-sch-1-sec-8-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "daa86d7eb33a4970c24b774ac8fb271cebe03ce977cd1443af319dbdcfd5b2fb",
      "skos:note": "Repeal paragraph and substitute with new liability provisions."
    },
    {
