      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "1 Subsection 22(1) (table item 2, column headed “Specific",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 10,
      "values:originalText": "requirements”)\nBefore “The Authority must consult a State”, insert:\nThe surface water of the Googong\nDam Area (within the meaning of\nthe Canberra Water Supply\n(Googong Dam) Act 1974) must be\nincluded in a water resource plan\narea for which the Australian\nCapital Territory (and not New\nSouth Wales) prepares a water\nresource plan (see section 63A)."
    },
