      "dc:source": "australian-capital-territory-water-management-legislation-amendment-act-2013.pdf, p.10",
      "values:originalText": "Capital Territory\n\nFor the purposes of this Act, the surface water of the Googong\nDam Area (within the meaning of the Canberra Water Supply\n(Googong Dam) Act 1974) is to be treated as if it were located in\nthe Australian Capital Territory (and not in New South Wales).",
      "skos:definition": "Capital Territory\n\nFor the purposes of this Act, the surface water of the Googong\nDam Area (within the meaning of the Canberra Water Supply\n(Googong Dam) Act 1974) is to be treated as if it were located in\nthe Australian Capital Territory (and not in New South Wales).",
      "cml:asserts": [
