      "dc:source": "australian-capital-territory-water-management-legislation-amendment-act-2013.pdf, p.12",
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n\n(1) The Executive, on behalf of the Commonwealth, has the functions\nof managing, protecting and using the water resources of the\nGoogong Dam Area in a way that is consistent with the objects of\nthe Water Resources Act 2007 (ACT).",
      "skos:definition": "Insert:\n\n(1) The Executive, on behalf of the Commonwealth, has the functions\nof managing, protecting and using the water resources of the\nGoogong Dam Area in a way that is consistent with the objects of\nthe Water Resources Act 2007 (ACT).",
      "cml:asserts": [
